    "text": "Missed the Northern Lights? You’ve Got Another Chance Tonight (and Tomorrow)\nBy Donny Meacham,\n4 hours agoWe rarely get second chances, but Mother Nature is giving us one. If you missed Monday or Tuesday night’s sky show, you’re in luck. The Northern Lights — yes, those Northern Lights — are expected to show up again tonight (Wednesday, July 16) and even into tomorrow (Thursday, July 17) across parts of the U.S.",
